Stardew Valley Expanded adds 4 new [[Stardew:Carpenter's Shop#Farm Buildinds|Farm Buildings]], 3 of which are available to be constructed on [[Stardew:The Farm|the Farm]]. The fourth is a special shed that can be repaired through a resource quest from Robin.

==Grandpa's Shed==
{{Main|Grandpa's Shed}}
[[File:Grandpas Shed.png|left|thumb|Grandpa's Shed (disrepair)]]
[[File:Grandpas Shed Fixed.png|left|thumb|Grandpa's Shed (fixed)]]
Grandpa's Shed is a special building that can be repaired and the interior refurbished. Once complete, the first floor can be used for machines, even casks, and the second floor contains greenhouse space.
{{clear}}

==Premium Barn==
{{Main|Premium Barn}}
[[File:Premium Barn.png|left|thumb|Premium Barn]]
The Premium Barn, once constructed, unlocks [[Bear (Animal)]] and [[Camel]] farm animals that can be purchased from [[Stardew:Marnie's Ranch|Marnie]]. All other [[Stardew:Animals|Barn animals]] can also live here.
{{clear}}

==Premium Coop==
{{Main|Premium Coop}}
[[File:Premium Coop.png|left|thumb|Premium Coop]]
The Premium Coop, once constructed, unlocks [[Goose]] farm animals that can be purchased from Marnie. All other [[Stardew:Animals|Coop animals]] can also live here.
{{clear}}

==Winery==
{{Main|Winery}}
[[File:Winery.png|left|thumb|Winery]]
Once players ship 500 bottles of wine, they will be able to construct the Winery on the farm, which allows casks placed inside to produce 15% faster.

{{clear}}
